@startuml
title 5.5 Context Carry-Forward — Virginia then Richmond
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

actor User
participant "FindCareApp" as UI
participant "PromptDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "HistoryMiddleware" as HistMW
participant "FindCarePromptFactory" as FCPF
participant "SpecialtyService" as SS
participant "FindCareService" as FCS

== Turn 1: "Find me a bone doc in Virginia" ==

User -> UI: "Find me a bone doc in Virginia"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)
note right: prompt_history: []\nsession_state: {last_state: null}

Dispatcher -> HistMW: process(input, next)
HistMW -> FCPF: route + execute
FCPF -> FCPF: extract location: state="VA"
FCPF -> FCPF: update session_state.last_state = "VA"
FCPF -> SS: find_specialty_codes("bone doc")
SS --> FCPF: {specialties: [{Code: "213E00000X"}]}
FCPF -> FCS: search_providers(codes=["213E00000X"], state="VA")
FCS --> FCPF: {providers: [...], total_count: 42}
FCPF --> Dispatcher: PromptOutput(providers, pagination)
Dispatcher --> UI: renders 42 providers in Virginia

== Turn 2: "What about in Richmond?" ==

User -> UI: "What about in Richmond?"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)
note right: prompt_history: [Turn 1]\nsession_state: {\n  last_state: "VA",\n  last_specialty: "213E00000X",\n  message_count: 1\n}

Dispatcher -> HistMW: process(input, next)
HistMW -> HistMW: append Turn 1 to history
HistMW -> FCPF: route + execute

FCPF -> FCPF: extract location: city="Richmond"
note right: No state in message.\nCheck session_state.last_state\n→ "VA" carried forward
FCPF -> FCPF: state = session_state.last_state = "VA"
FCPF -> FCPF: specialty = session_state.last_specialty

FCPF -> FCS: search_providers(\n  specialty_codes=["213E00000X"],\n  state="VA",\n  city="Richmond",\n  limit=25)
FCS -> FCS: _facet_query with\n  {taxonomy_code: {$in: codes},\n   state: "VA",\n   city: /richmond/i}
FCS --> FCPF: {providers: [...], total_count: 8}

FCPF -> FCPF: update session_state.last_city = "Richmond"
FCPF --> Dispatcher: PromptOutput(providers,\npagination={total: 8})
Dispatcher --> UI: renders 8 providers in Richmond, VA

note over User, UI: Context carry-forward:\nVirginia carried from Turn 1\nSpecialty carried from Turn 1\nOnly city was new in Turn 2

@enduml
